# Admin UI — Sneat style

Reference: [Sneat vertical menu template](https://demos.themeselection.com/sneat-bootstrap-html-admin-template/html/vertical-menu-template/)

When building or changing **admin** frontend (`frontend/src/components/admin`, `frontend/src/pages/admin`, `frontend/src/styles/admin`):

- Keep **vertical sidebar + sticky rounded navbar + `#f5f5f9` content bg** shell from `AdminLayout`.
- Primary: `#696cff`. Headings: `#566a7f`. Muted: `#a1acb8`. Cards: white, soft shadow, `0.5rem` radius.
- Font: **Public Sans**.
- Prefer Bootstrap 5 + existing `admin.css` utilities (`.card`, `.page-title`, `.menu-link`, `.bg-label-*`, `.table-ls`, `.badge-ls`).
- Layout content is `container-fluid` (list, add, edit — everywhere). No fixed max-width cards.
- New admin pages: page title row + content inside `.card` / `.card-body`.
- List pages: Sneat **basic table** markup directly in the page (`.card` > `.table-responsive.text-nowrap` > `table.table`, `tbody.table-border-bottom-0`, `badge bg-label-*`, row `dropdown` with `hide-arrow` dots). No generic datatable component. Keep server-side filter/pagination, Refresh, Export CSV, row Actions (NotifySphere behavior); pager via `ListPaginationBar`.
- Sidebar collapse/expand sirf border pe baithe primary-color arrow button se (navbar me hamburger sirf mobile).
- Topbar (`AdminNavbar`, sab admin pages pe): Language, Light/Dark/System theme, Notifications, Profile dropdowns.
- Colors hardcode mat karo — `variables.css` ke `--ls-*` vars use karo taaki dark mode chale.
- Add / Edit alag page pe nahi — list page pe `components/common/Modal` me (`pages/admin/<Module>/FormModal.jsx`), save ke baad list `load()`.
- List me ID nahi, **Sr No** (`(page - 1) * limit + idx + 1`).
- Export hamesha server-side: controller me `EXPORT_HEADERS` + `exportList` (list wala hi query builder) → backend `sendExport(res, { headers, data, filename, type })`. Frontend `apiDownload` + `EXPORT_TYPE_CODES` dropdown.
- Naming: folders lowercase (`pages/admin/organization`, `auth`); React component files PascalCase `.jsx`; non-component JS camelCase `.js`.
- API calls sirf `apiRequest(path, body, { token, method })` (`services/api.js`) — JSON ho ya file, dono handle.
- Toast / confirm: `notify`, `confirmAction` from `utils/custom.js`. Frontend + backend dono me kaam aane wale constants/pure helpers root `constants.mjs` me.
- Shared frontend helpers (pagination, CSV export, labels, theme, initials) sirf `utils/custom.js` me; pehle wahan dekho, duplicate mat banao.
- Do **not** invent a different admin theme (no dark sidebar by default, no unrelated purple gradients, no flat grey boxes without Sneat card look).
- Auth pages stay on `AuthLayout` + `auth.css` (same palette).
